{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"8d171cb121896da54179a65707fba35e98d2c10d482752fee0e00e0f5e8ac19e","ja":"勝負の行方","zh":"胜负的走向","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e7e5b2858abfb56d78f9c68581de22b380cd6dfc3c76091f7ba417675bb7af4b","ja":"メガ盛り焼きそばの屋台、偵察してきました。\n後半戦はさらに増量して勝負に出ているようです。","zh":"我去超大份炒面摊侦察过了。\n后半程他们似乎还要再加量，发起全面挑战呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d989b813449adc510c95e187b8bce9d264345f91288df98c9a781d662259b45c","ja":"それにソースの香ばしい香りが\nとても食欲をそそり、列を延ばしていて……。","zh":"而且酱汁焦香扑鼻的香气\n极其诱人食欲，让队伍越来越长……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2db782fb2bcbfafed9bab7cda6e5a36eaee730a78adf87c3b3fe5d2aff3702a1","ja":"うう……聞いてるだけで、お腹がすいてきた。\n自分も、いろんな屋台を回ってみたいぞ……。","zh":"呜呜……光是听着，肚子就饿了。\n我也好想逛逛各种摊位啊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6008e1d23418b0a194a43b353d249dc414c615ff2fe2c9ca44997e29aa3736ec","ja":"……そうだ！　いいことを思いついたぞ！\nこれなら……。","zh":"……有了！我想到了一个好主意！\n这样的话……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2f46813d0b3f1939dedb8ad498db455a224b0e7d52ef468a036eda8592ae77de","ja":"え！？　ねこまんじゅうと\nシークワーサージュースのセット売り！？","zh":"咦！？　猫馒头和\n平实柠檬汁的套餐出售！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"955275ea9b3b515c599ec7c805fea10e371cdd4b26e371d84c95264698cd4418","ja":"うん！　甘いものと酸っぱいものは、\n最高の組み合わせだぞ！","zh":"嗯！甜的和酸的，\n可是绝配哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"51020843ee5026f54912a852db9b337dd1decdd39e81ed596b87534e14e216e0","ja":"それに、屋台を2つ回らなくても、\n1度で両方買えるから、とってもお得さー！","zh":"而且，不用逛2个摊位，\n1次就能把两样都买齐，非常划算哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"2dcdb8deaa65d2a71e10c1ec82c94635938d450b133ecdc2ef26b51a4d3b2ea5","ja":"うーん……それはわかるけど……。\n茜ちゃんたちとの勝負はどうなるの？","zh":"嗯……话是这么说啦……\n那和小茜她们的比试该怎么办呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"28a8c4cf32628f77544293cfadd7fe209d2895d896d3210d41efab424aed97f3","ja":"勝負の相手は自分たちだけじゃないでしょ？","zh":"对手可不只是我们自己吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"6e76831754831a395c1eca36b974559636b82ada9625bdce4eae2509cc9d4e9e","ja":"そう言われたらそうね。それに私、\nシークワーサージュースの味が気になってたし……。","zh":"这么说也确实是呢。而且我也\n一直挺好奇平实柠檬汁的味道……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"347bd4819d47bdbecb181c52e8caae527c5de9152acc4ea943d5e21612c6fdf5","ja":"ねこまんじゅうと両方に興味があるお客さん、\nけっこういるんじゃないかしら？","zh":"对猫馒头和这双方面都感兴趣的客人，\n说不定还挺多的呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"2200cfea02d007e7105824a828ad05aaf09549d8c101698d459efea32eefaee4","ja":"えへへ～、実は自分も、\nねこまんじゅうを食べてみたいって思ってたんだ♪","zh":"嘿嘿～其实我自己，\n也早就想尝尝看猫猫馒头了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"301b5d6d761754aebdb337bd39412087a11b0c670f7997ae650dff437573df7a","ja":"仕方ないニャ～。こうなったら、ねこまんじゅうと\nシークワーサージュースのセットで勝負だよ！","zh":"没办法喵～。既然这样，就用猫猫馒头和\n平实柠檬汁的套餐来决胜负吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"bfbe302c9d32a7b9b65f5173113998b7eba9241dbc60e4d5e6680f7a58ff62c9","ja":"その2時間後、フェスの終了を告げる\nアナウンスが流れて……","zh":"在那2小时后，宣布音乐节落幕的\n广播播出了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"a67968ffa4c8301a963ea2563da02807691bfb22cdbdf6a1bf5da7e80ab18493","ja":"「フード売り上げ今回の1番人気は……シークワーサー\nジュースとねこまんじゅうのセットです！」","zh":"“本次最受欢迎的餐点销量1是……平实柠檬\n果汁与猫咪馒头套餐！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"00818c11a76fca33fd69911752fc955593b27617fe8e9fc920f6b6f9722e893f","ja":"やった～！　自分たちが優勝さー！","zh":"太棒啦～！是我们赢得了冠军哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"8aeef2f1528de0ff826caba83620d3cebe652f2d9075247a64866aecbd94c1f5","ja":"うんうん！\nさっすが茜ちゃんたち、だよね♪","zh":"嗯嗯！\n真不愧是小茜她们呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1094.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"5167275b3abd0f52d289f9683ced5c9e8188898150ddd77cfbd85bb741f2bc77","ja":"うん！　力を合わせた自分たちは、\nいつもよりもっともっとカンペキだからね♪","zh":"嗯！齐心协力的我们，\n可是比平时还要更加完美的哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
